From 9afd60cca140881288498fc21058b404814c08e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:18:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(init): support bounded owned vectors and chunked writes

Use one bounded iovec snapshot for owned files and pipes, retaining pipe
atomicity and strict tracee copies. Process regular writes and pwrites in
4 KiB scratch chunks up to 1 MiB and report only committed progress.
Keep native transfer policy unchanged.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
